{"id":"n83085-1-6","stage":4,"title":"폐 · 麻烦","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n83085-1-6-1","ko":"식당에서는 조용히 하렴. 다른 사람들에게 폐가 되잖니.","zh":"在餐厅里安静点，会打扰别人的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"식당에서는","meaning":"饭店，餐厅","explanation":"식당：饭店，餐厅；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"식당","audio":"/audio/fe047fb6c566f2771257.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36693","senseId":"2","lemma":"식당","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"식당에서는","audio":"/audio/be2e149d2f1a33d99d96.mp3"}},{"text":"조용히","meaning":"安静地","explanation":"조용히：安静地","readings":[{"term":"조용히","audio":"/audio/ae038c58a11863122784.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75797","senseId":"1","lemma":"조용히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"조용히","audio":"/audio/ae038c58a11863122784.mp3"}},{"text":"하렴.","meaning":"给别人产生某种影响或怎样对待别人。","explanation":"하다：给别人产生某种影响或怎样对待别人。；렴：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"24","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하렴","audio":"/audio/79f9f70081bccfb50604.mp3"}},{"text":"다른","meaning":"其他，别的","explanation":"다른：其他，别的","readings":[{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64530","senseId":"1","lemma":"다른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}},{"text":"사람들에게","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람들에게","audio":"/audio/07dda46abe0101013ba3.mp3"}},{"text":"폐가","meaning":"麻烦，打扰，打搅","explanation":"폐：麻烦，打扰，打搅；가：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"폐","audio":"/audio/60d2874695aab4a214c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83085","senseId":"1","lemma":"폐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"폐가","audio":"/audio/a3e50b7b69998eb9bd7c.mp3"}},{"text":"되잖니.","meaning":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","explanation":"되다：某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。；잖니：提醒听者双方已知的事实，带反问或确认语气：“不是……吗”。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"20","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되잖니","audio":"/audio/3c0de5136e0e6312cbb2.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"fe047fb6c566f277","term":"식당","zh":"饭店，餐厅","audio":"/audio/fe047fb6c566f2771257.mp3","entryId":"36693","definition":"制做并出售食物的商店。","pronunciation":["식땅"]},{"id":"ae038c58a1186312","term":"조용히","zh":"安静地","audio":"/audio/ae038c58a11863122784.mp3","entryId":"75797","definition":"任何声音都没有地。","pronunciation":["조용히"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"给别人产生某种影响或怎样对待别人。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"给别人产生某种影响或怎样对待别人。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"f1f4ce417552e197","term":"다른","zh":"其他，别的","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3","entryId":"64530","definition":"除相关之外的。","pronunciation":["다른"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"60d2874695aab4a2","term":"폐","zh":"麻烦，打扰，打搅","audio":"/audio/60d2874695aab4a214c9.mp3","entryId":"83085","definition":"给别人造成损害或烦扰他人。","pronunciation":["폐ː","페ː"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/697cfd8e1a5659c117b1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n83085-1-6-2","ko":"네, 죄송해요.","zh":"好的，对不起。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"죄송해요.","meaning":"抱歉，愧疚","explanation":"죄송하다：抱歉，愧疚；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"죄송하다","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91763","senseId":"1","lemma":"죄송하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"죄송해요","audio":"/audio/e9f7fd1f9febb8b27ec0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"656cf6c32585f66d","term":"죄송하다","zh":"抱歉，愧疚","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3","entryId":"91763","definition":"好像犯了错一样感觉十分过意不去。","pronunciation":["죄ː송하다","줴ː송하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/fee771b07157f4f3adf9.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.816,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=83085","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":121,"sequenceScore":1.6427,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["在餐厅里安静点，会打扰别人的。","好的，对不起。","发生什么事了？气氛怎么像丧家一样啊？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["在餐厅里安静点，会打扰别人的。","好的，对不起。","发生什么事了？气氛怎么像丧家一样啊？"],"answer":1}]}
